  "details": "I suggest adding a posting function similar to the \"X\" website to the game's friend\n\nsystem. Players could update their observations in real-time through the friend system,\n\nand their friends,even those not on the same map, could see it. This would effectively\n\nstrengthen friendships. Even if a friend hasn't been seen or chatted with for a long time,\n\nseeing their latest \"update\" might spark their interest and lead to a conversation.\n\nI believe this is a crucial feature that could significantly boost player engagement and\n\ngame activity. Currently, many veteran VRChat players lack enthusiasm because they've\n\ndrifted apart from their friends simply due to a period of inactivity. This feature could\n\naddress this issue.",
